OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785516479
OL,3,CBritish dad charged over son's death
OL,4,Cin Cyprus seeks travel restrictions
OL,5,Clifted
OL,7,FA British man charged with negligence
OL,8,Fover the death of his three-year-old
OL,9,Fson in Cyprus is seeking to have
OL,10,Ftravel restrictions temporarily lifted
OL,11,Fso he can join his family in the UK
OL,12,Ffor the boy's funeral.
OL,14,FThe 37-year-old man and his family
OL,15,Fwere reportedly just a few days into a
OL,16,Fholiday in the Cypriot resort town of
OL,17,FPaphos earlier this month when his
OL,18,Fthree-year-old fell from a fourth-
OL,19,Ffloor hotel window.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
