FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785516479
OL,3,CBritish dad charged over son's death
OL,4,Cin Cyprus seeks travel restrictions
OL,5,Clifted
OL,7,FThe circumstances of the fall remain
OL,8,Funclear.
OL,10,FHis lawyer, Alexandros Alexandrou,
OL,11,Fsaid he will file an application next
OL,12,Fweek seeking to have the travel
OL,13,Frestriction temporarily lifted, with
OL,14,Fthe boy's funeral expected to be
OL,15,Farranged after the court delivers its
OL,16,Fdecision by August 7.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785516479
OL,3,CBritish dad charged over son's death
OL,4,Cin Cyprus seeks travel restrictions
OL,5,Clifted
OL,7,FThe defendant was arrested and
OL,8,Fcharged, but a court later released
OL,9,Fhim from custody on the condition that
OL,10,Fhe surrender his passport, report to a
OL,11,Fpolice station weekly and pay a
OL,12,FE20,000 (around #17,100) bond.
OL,14,F"Clearly this is tragic, it's a case
OL,15,Fwhere anyone, whether they're a parent
OL,16,For not, can understand the stress of
OL,17,Fhaving lost a child," Alexandrou said.
OL,26,@tD@AOkvD@AOUyD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/6
