FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785516479
OL,3,CBritish dad charged over son's death
OL,4,Cin Cyprus seeks travel restrictions
OL,5,Clifted
OL,7,F"Right now the only issue before the
OL,8,Fcourt is for the petition on this
OL,9,Fhumanitarian aspect of the case to be
OL,10,Fapproved so that he can travel for his
OL,11,Fson's funeral."
OL,13,FThe lawyer said his client's wife and
OL,14,Ffive-year-old son returned to the UK
OL,15,Ftwo days ago, while the man was joined
OL,16,Fin court by his parents.
OL,18,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,19,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,20,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,21,Finbox every Friday morning.
