PN,30805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785516479
OL,3,CBritish dad charged over son's death
OL,4,Cin Cyprus seeks travel restrictions
OL,5,Clifted
OL,7,FIf the application is approved, the
OL,8,Fcase is expected to continue in mid-
OL,9,FSeptember after the court's summer
OL,10,Frecess.
OL,12,FAlexandrou said his client was due to
OL,13,Fenter a plea on Friday but requested
OL,14,Fan adjournment to allow time to file
OL,15,Fthe petition.
OL,17,FThe lawyer took over the 37-year-old's
OL,18,Fdefence on Wednesday after his
OL,19,Fprevious attorney withdrew from the
OL,20,Fcase.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
